meta {
	name: 03_DifferentRightKeysAtOnce
	seq: 3
}

docs {
	Scenario: The requester asks for two different rights on the same resource at once

		Given the approver has no pending request from the requester for the resource
		And the approver can delegate at least two rights on the resource
		When the requester asks for one right and, at the same time, for another right
		Then one call returns 200 and the other 409 with AM-00054
		And the requester has exactly one pending request, with the rights of the call that won
		Finally the approver rejects the pending requests to clean up

	One request may be pending per resource: a request for other rights while one is pending is
	rejected with 409. Sent at the same time, both calls can pass that check today.
	Skipped until the fix for #3931 is deployed.
}
